[{"title":"送吴坦求","author":"徐积","text":"清风门外客移船，南郭衰翁但惘然。\n未吐赤心无限事，重寻皓首几何年。\n茶须饱饭吞甘溜，酒便空心注玉泉。\n醉倒淮东郑云叟，吟哦声调入云烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42896,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠颖叔","author":"徐积","text":"一从西郭恩初重，又至南庠义更深。\n自恨杜微无所听，若忘龚遂是何心。\n已知霜露情弥感，更值淮湖气作阴。\n昨夜起来无月色，谁知我为蒋公吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42897,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答李闳中节推","author":"徐积","text":"王家池上芙蓉客，曾把新诗赠野人。\n不道形骸成土木，却言风月长精神。\n凡禽易识甘题凤，野兽难分误比麟。\n努力唱歌酬不得，枉教白雪落红尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42898,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和沈判官","author":"徐积","text":"精神满腹其才裕，清白当官所性存。\n国士正居王俭府，野人未识李膺门。\n诗筒便恐传新句，酒席方陪饮上樽。\n从此定须怀贱叟，他时来访我儿孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42899,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢蔡子骧","author":"徐积","text":"好客重来直上厅，庞家妻女合炊粳。\n名言一坐令谁听，老病双瞳为子明。\n有道长官方就禄，无能司户欲归耕。\n如斯出处俱平易，义理难时即共评。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42900,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄朱至机 其一","author":"徐积","text":"云出无心鹤倦飞，还家欢笑綵为衣。\n雪醅为寿酒初熟，玉脔供甘鱼正肥。\n侍燕每操筇杖去，看花常御板舆归。\n故人愿子无穷庆，莫使淮南音信稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42901,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄朱至机 其二","author":"徐积","text":"六十诗翁爱幅巾，清江濯尽洛阳尘。\n若无野客来同巷，合有山僧去作邻。\n醉卧不知云到枕，吟行唯许鹤随身。\n眼看富贵真如梦，说到穷通定笑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42902,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄颖叔","author":"徐积","text":"南郭茶杯菊未香，西檐老柳觉疏黄。\n家无县令双凫舄，梦有仙人五色羊。\n梅信易传来岭北，雁书难附过衡阳。\n定知远俗怀公义，若说威名背负芒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42903,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送娄六秀才","author":"徐积","text":"趋时之悔真良说，枉己之徒信厚颜。\n学者渊源当似海，丈夫持守要如山。\n挺然特起麟孤角，鄙矣谁窥豹一斑。\n为子临行双泣下，白头人倚夕阳关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42904,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和杨守清容堂","author":"徐积","text":"赤县堂名清与容，主人兼得古人风。\n此閒便是烟波上，何处更寻山谷中。\n志激懦贪无弊俗，诏宣宽大有馀功。\n若将全德评今昔，应笑陈蕃郭令公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42905,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书狄梁公传","author":"徐积","text":"李氏山河势若蓬，手提长剑截长虹。\n请将唐室中兴事，可比汾阳再造功。\n直道不为邪党败，逆鳞深得诤臣风。\n儒生若有逢时幸，未必勋劳尽在公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42906,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜赏春寄敦复","author":"徐积","text":"莫道山阳官苦辛，大夫未是不閒人。\n昼来琴上披寻曲，夜入花閒点检春。\n拖袂带归香满袖，回灯引去蝶随身。\n高才自有风流格，吟作吴谣事最新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42907,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏答君锡酣战之句","author":"徐积","text":"檄书插羽来何速，铁骑成林势未分。\n北垒啖声雄似虎，南营杀气猛如云。\n阵前剑客投犀袂，帐外歌姬曳绣裙。\n且待挥兵酣战罢，却行三舍避将军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42908,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和崔刑部凭栏","author":"徐积","text":"伏读凭栏意，私心辄慨然。\n圣徒须企圣，贤党必思贤。\n主上方高枕，民閒正息肩。\n使君当自逸，治状已光前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42909,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示汝弼","author":"徐积","text":"十载交情义有馀，离群还叹索然居。\n一番思我须成梦，每度人来定寄书。\n此日相从尤款密，他时何处觅迂疏。\n回来径哭青墩墓，莫向南城问旧庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42910,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汝弼","author":"徐积","text":"芦叶衔来逢北雁，筠筒信断候南风。\n看回白马残阳后，吟尽閒云落月中。\n酌水何时寻陆子，寄裙前日为梁鸿。\n孟光多谢闺房秀，醉酒亡缯是我翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42911,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈敦复","author":"徐积","text":"朝奉清心自皎然，应将外物比腥膻。\n诗歌与性相娱乐，声色因丧永弃捐。\n有义眷余东野旧，无能留子北窗眠。\n殷勤为釂陶家酒，更送瓷杯与竹笺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42912,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代书寄次翁","author":"徐积","text":"病叟虽迂阔，交情自不疏。\n喜逢归去客，为谢寄来书。\n入幕评文后，临川视事馀。\n携壶吟两柳，还梦野人居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42913,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上蒋公","author":"徐积","text":"公如郑相怜穷士，我在所知韩孟閒。\n下客心形浑是木，高贤礼义欲齐山。\n十年用力人谁及，百计酬恩事总艰。\n投笔若从班定远，横戈先出玉门关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42914,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉退居","author":"徐积","text":"彼美东南隽，尧时作外臣。\n有何归去物，全得老来身。\n一节都无变，平生总是真。\n勇于罗守退，甘似庾郎贫。\n士望今谁耦，儒林旧绝伦。\n其心醇是本，以德厚为珍。\n避盗抽园笋，容奴取库银。\n时情付流水，外物尽浮云。\n久矣谋閒坐，谁乎愿要津。\n书藏万卷好，诗换一筒新。\n聚道为家法，分粮恤外姻。\n清风还楚部，馀惠在江民。\n藉草宜兰佩，穿松称鹿巾。\n鲙材须活鲤，羹剂要香莼。\n日暖花村路，风温荇浦春。\n耽吟白居士，沈醉李仙人。\n骥凤鸣来久，驹雏教已驯。\n义终光国史，名自压朝绅。\n顾我愚而陋，烦公爱以仁。\n深恩无报处，北望正劳神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42915,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送至机","author":"徐积","text":"闭门有幸藏衰病，策杖无因奉俊游。\n绳缠筋骸方就枕，火烧皮骨正思秋。\n览君健句如逢药，慰我孤怀胜凭楼。\n见说束装行未得，梦魂先到楚江头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42916,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄路倅洪泽阻水 其一","author":"徐积","text":"黄金宫阙紫瑶关，鹓鹭思陪玉笋班。\n仙仗好教凫舄去，客槎却在斗牛閒。\n有为义对霜涛涌，无敌诗同铁阵閒。\n谁报京师群弟子，先生吏隐鬓毛斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42917,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄路倅洪泽阻水 其二","author":"徐积","text":"莫教容易过龟山，多少人心愿复还。\n更有南城黄绶客，但吟西户绿杨閒。\n才经浊汴无澄浪，且趁清淮洗醉颜。\n安得就公歌一曲，缓吟迟步夕阳湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42918,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘朝奉邹国公配飨","author":"徐积","text":"丹书一下人神庆，美矣先朝贵孟公。\n能与百王兴漏典，长令万国仰遗风。\n躬为独行生无禄，道配弥高祭有宫。\n孰谓阔迂穷至死，正而穷胜枉而通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42919,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其一","author":"徐积","text":"世俗纷纷事总虚，诗翁今作逸人居。\n勤穿东地缘栽竹，喜占明窗为著书。\n近市好赊春肆酒，就淮仍买晚罾鱼。\n忽撑小艇来西郭，不问皆知访仲车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42920,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其二","author":"徐积","text":"诗翁爱酒典衣沽，六子将孙侍燕居。\n正要白家醇酿法，不须刘德伪金书。\n厨经雪后炊无黍，门近淮濒食有鱼。\n何以献公寻一物，庾郎三韭载盈车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42921,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其三","author":"徐积","text":"昔也闻名诵子虚，今来白颔隔城居。\n新诗解道论头句，旧客仍移把臂书。\n北郭高风真隐豹，南州循政喻烹鱼。\n归时见说临川路，父老争留太守车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42922,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其四","author":"徐积","text":"陈傅门前客姓徐，有何智术佐閒居。\n接檐俛仰令遮雨，缚竹纵横为架书。\n趁雪斸田移草木，和湾汲水贮龟鱼。\n上元已过清明近，更约寻花不用车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42923,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其五","author":"徐积","text":"谁家住处近田庐，朝奉抽簪就退居。\n竹叶已成新岁酒，梅花未领故人书。\n呼童解袂扪饥虱，趁日开箱曝蠹鱼。\n一似散仙閒到夜，卧屏仍看五云车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42924,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其六","author":"徐积","text":"坐想堂前弄白须，蒲茵笋席正高居。\n綵衣六子傍供膳，锦髻诸孙自教书。\n爱士主人新置榻，清身太守旧悬鱼。\n更吟整斗论头句，胜却西庵诗一车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42925,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其七","author":"徐积","text":"不辨时人直与迂，浊缨且喜近淮居。\n朝衣脱后常耽睡，野史修时或借书。\n恨乏青山供采药，爱看白鸟伺吞鱼。\n东园卖酒花开近，待看诗翁倒载车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42926,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其八","author":"徐积","text":"簿领脱来如一梦，身名全后喜宁居。\n生来自信无非义，世上何缘作谤书。\n所养有源数大水，其贤可乐比嘉鱼。\n愿公八十为更老，玉币三招乃就车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42927,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其九","author":"徐积","text":"自是平时大隐徒，何须水宿与山居。\n都无长物垂空橐，却有閒房聚逸书。\n近见雪消思野蕨，遥呼船问忆江鱼。\n卸帆便去寻村酒，醉使儿孙推鹿车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42928,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其十","author":"徐积","text":"身著练袍履用蒲，鹖冠鸠杖称郊居。\n家中但乏青囊印，坐处便看黄卷书。\n赁屋为无扬子宅，休官非为武昌鱼。\n长年不出何妨事，况是门悬致仕车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42929,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其十一","author":"徐积","text":"夷白先生好对庐，醉吟处士作邻居。\n幅巾自去呼樵父，蜡屐何时访竹书。\n坐想高谈摇麈尾，情知相谇跨鲸鱼。\n更怜同姓陪樽酒，胜却荀生得御车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42930,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其十二","author":"徐积","text":"路家巷口是何渠，半似城中半野居。\n已退白仙常按曲，未归陆俊谩传书。\n雪消墙外逢挑菜，日暖门前见捕鱼。\n更有花閒行处乐，旧时歌舞愿随车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42931,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其十三","author":"徐积","text":"好养玄猿共鹤雏，茅茨盖屋竹閒居。\n家无越使千金橐，腹有齐臣四部书。\n一自临川登画鹢，便烦别驾掌铜鱼。\n吟哦还作诗仙退，恰似骖鸾凤驾车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42932,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其十四","author":"徐积","text":"世閒诗淡郑云叟，寿且安宁陶隐居。\n爱酒自开浮蚁瓮，耽诗如好换鹅书。\n箨冠戴后支筇竹，鹤氅披来控鲤鱼。\n学作蓬莱吟醉客，何须驷马驾安车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42933,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路朝奉新居 其十五","author":"徐积","text":"西庵翁上北城隅，为望临川旧守居。\n所恨足无双翅舄，但将诗代一函书。\n甥教洗游多沽酒，妻使磨刀细切鱼。\n洒扫待公来献寿，亲扶杖履醉升车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42934,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送路倅 其一","author":"徐积","text":"所居有本能行义，此去无人不恋恩。\n情似绿波长送棹，梦如飞絮忽随轩。\n帐前旧学千馀子，橐里新文数万言。\n何日从君温故业，待操几杖问渊源。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42935,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送路倅 其二","author":"徐积","text":"我曹初作綵衣郎，白纻先生正擅场。\n大笔可堪专簿领，远图终恐用文章。\n清淮绝唱新盈卷，绿发奇篇旧满囊。\n此去功名都未测，公年方永力方强。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42936,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和石宣德五柳亭","author":"徐积","text":"五柳神君气貌端，所希所向静而安。\n每思往行投閒地，肯逐时情慕热官。\n秫酒易醒风户猛，葛巾难卧月窗寒。\n也应种得东篱菊，好置篮舆自在观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42937,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送秦漕","author":"徐积","text":"昭昭所性详而辨，坦坦其行乐且恬。\n公义已令淮部肃，清风更入朔方严。\n行无瑕颣孤标耸，养有根源数器兼。\n犹使樵夫来教我，樵歌为述古人谦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42938,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送宫教郎朝奉","author":"徐积","text":"博士高才御点名，往陪群俊盍朝簪。\n门颁锦诏先生入，帝锡绨衣后殿深。\n设坐宫官严绛帐，执经王子肃青衿。\n尧亲已被钦文化，更倚师谟称上心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42939,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李宪 其一","author":"徐积","text":"使臣车用赤帷裳，帝选明侯重岭阳。\n后乘未离淮分野，先声已遍越封疆。\n宜教廉吏心如水，但恐贪夫背有霜。\n大抵当官须去害，人閒所在有豺狼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42940,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李宪 其二","author":"徐积","text":"五船鸣鼓待严装，且赴双莲旧燕堂。\n不用水沈薰紫绶，过梅林后一身香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42941,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程守 其一","author":"徐积","text":"楚人相唤守河梁，鸣角楼前驻画樯。\n未肯放船来北渚，且教载酒去东堂。\n倾城和气传芳草，沿路清风配绿杨。\n见说新班名玉笋，赤墀登对待冯唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42942,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程守 其二","author":"徐积","text":"闻道西城欲解船，病翁怀抱更骚然。\n将心已附诸生辈，策杖难随庶老肩。\n负义本非今世俗，报恩终愧古人贤。\n不才自讼无他技，合作诗歌更百篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42943,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送人从军","author":"徐积","text":"古来雄隽是从军，问罪残羌正有名。\n黑槊将陪黄钺帅，银鎗队拥铁林兵。\n十州假息恩涵覆，百载逋诛事贯盈。\n首恶更应囚巨轞，壮图难议请长缨。\n须空大漠迁降虏，好决洪河刷逆城。\n报国主人心更勇，西山勒颂得班生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42944,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠山翁","author":"徐积","text":"耳听人言似不闻，心于时事若无分。\n一生已是青山物，更欲将身换白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42945,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山翁答无分之句","author":"徐积","text":"身边外物虽无语，事到中心自有分。\n莫道山翁头似雪，心如剑戟气如云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42946,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢张才甫筇竹杖 其一","author":"徐积","text":"老来无物可支颐，正要一茎筇竹枝。\n满袖清风秋月淡，陶潜绕遍菊花篱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42947,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢张才甫筇竹杖 其二","author":"徐积","text":"手中忽把一枝筇，称我逍遥林下风。\n不是西征车上物，临行自合与诗翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42948,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏呈魏评事 其一","author":"徐积","text":"北斋有酒夜开门，独酌灯前酒一樽。\n只被诗魔无处避，待教醉魄战吟魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42949,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏呈魏评事 其二","author":"徐积","text":"我向灯前置酒杯，南轩北户一时开。\n如今正是花时节，且放春风数路来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42950,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏呈魏评事 其三","author":"徐积","text":"紫府瑶关夜更深，阿谁閒醉洞中春。\n呼童去问烟霞事，只见桃花不见人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42951,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄江子和","author":"徐积","text":"为问江行辈，何时访白须。\n老怀何所慰，得子寄来书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42952,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路太博","author":"徐积","text":"莫教竹马误群儿，谢守行春未可知。\n落尽梅花寒食近，却应桃李怪来迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42953,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢颖叔","author":"徐积","text":"能歌白雪公常事，不醉黄花我几曾。\n一绝便胜书一纸，情知高义过刘弘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42954,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄王观文","author":"徐积","text":"扁舟欲泛湘江月，亦泛洞庭湖上春。\n十年此意逢今日，且喜洪州有主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42955,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别崔刑部","author":"徐积","text":"黄金何日上燕台，致主犹轻乐毅才。\n便是功名未如意，报恩宁肯惜重来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42956,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送秦少游","author":"徐积","text":"叟罢耕耘妾罢机，匆匆人意甚牵衣。\n可怜数里笙歌地，但见一番杨柳稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42957,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送慎彦邻赴举","author":"徐积","text":"天子诏多士，喜君为此行。\n美璞必三献，大禽终一鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42958,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄蔡子骧","author":"徐积","text":"为报庐陵客，逢人且寄声。\n不知无恙否，何日到南城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42959,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送管久中","author":"徐积","text":"半开醉眼天方晓，急遣诗筒去已迟。\n别恨离愁无尽处，青山绿水有穷时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42960,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠郑毅夫","author":"徐积","text":"致主跻民道未完，白衣卿相且盘桓。\n龙头已是输君早，更向麒麟阁上看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42961,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏答何楚才酒肆","author":"徐积","text":"身在尘埃气在云，丈夫贫贱岂须论。\n且为韩信淮阴事，休著相如犊鼻裈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42962,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]